    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45676" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stuppĕus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stūpĕus</span></b> ), a,
		um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>made</i> or <i>consisting of tow</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vincula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 2, 236</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">retinacula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 14, 547</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">verbera fundae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 1, 309</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flamma,</span>”
				<i>burning tow</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					8, 694</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">messis,</span>”
				i. e. <i>flax</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Grat. Cyn. 36</span></i>
			.</div>
